>>
Rule 1 (Input tensor 'x' should not be of boolean type to avoid InvalidArgumentError related to allowed 'T' values in Sum operation)
{x : tensor} |= dtype_(x) ≠ 0
>>
Rule 2 (Input tensor 'x' must be at least 2-dimensional to avoid InvalidArgumentError in MatrixDiagPartV3)
{x : tensor} |= ndim(x) ≥ 2
>>
Rule 4 (Input tensor 'x' must have a valid shape)
{x : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(x) - 1] : shape(x, i) > 0
>>
Rule 9 (Input tensor 'x' dimensions should be greater than 1)
{x : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(x) - 1] : shape(x, i) > 1
>>
Rule 14 (Inner dimensions of x must be greater than 0)
{x : tensor} |= shape(x, ndim(x) - 1) > 0 ∧ shape(x, ndim(x) - 2) > 0
>>
Rule 19 (The last two dimensions of input x must exist and be greater than 0)
{x : tensor} |= ndim(x) ≥ 2 ∧ shape(x, ndim(x) - 1) > 0 ∧ shape(x, ndim(x) - 2) > 0
>>
Rule 39 (Inner dimensions must be positive integers.)
{x : tensor} |= shape(x, ndim(x) - 1) > 0 ∧ shape(x, ndim(x) - 2) > 0 ∧ ndim(x) ≥ 2
